# Flamewake Phoenix, a 2/2 flier with haste, "attacks each combat if able" (CR 508.1d): declaring no attackers is refused, and on turn 1 it hits for 2 (20 to 18). Bot2's Lightning Bolt kills it on turn 2. On turn 3 Bot1 casts an Alpine Grizzly (power 4), so at the beginning of combat Ferocious triggers from the graveyard and paying {R} (a Mox Ruby) returns it; with haste it attacks again for 2 (16).

